## Headline numbers

* **Per request:** registrar core {{fit.RegisterFresh.T.small.intercept|f:0}} ns + {{fit.RegisterFresh.T.small.slope|f:2}} ns per ad of
  the topic for a `REGTOPIC`; {{fit.RandomNodes.T.all.slope|f:1}} ns per ad of the topic for a lookup.{{if:share.cgo.total_ns}}
  With validation a `REGTOPIC` costs {{share.cgo.total_ns|sig:2}} ns, i.e. about
  {{share.cgo.regtopic_per_core|sig:2}} per second on one core.{{endif}}
* **Equilibrium:** at C = 1000 with production advertisers, {{demand.C1000-fresh5.utilisation|pct:1}} of C is
  occupied at 5 fresh attempts/s; admissions saturate at {{demand.C1000-fresh100.admission_rps|f:2}}/s and the
  rest of the demand abandons ({{demand.C1000-fresh100.abandon_fraction|pct:1}} at 100 attempts/s).
* **Memory:** {{mem.C1000-empirical-maxenr.independent.at_capacity_mib|f:2}} MiB for a full default cache of
  maximum-size records.
* **Throughput:** {{if:rt.knee_requests_rps}}{{rt.knee_requests_rps|sig:3}} requests/s served without queueing on one core.{{else}}provisional, {{cap.implied_min|sig:2}}–{{cap.implied_max|sig:2}} requests/s implied by per-call costs.{{endif}}

